.SH rclone archive create
Archive source file(s) to destination.
.SS Synopsis
Creates an archive from the files in source:path and saves the archive
to dest:path.
If dest:path is missing, it will write to the console.
.PP
The valid formats for the \f[CR]\-\-format\f[R] flag are listed below.
If \f[CR]\-\-format\f[R] is not set rclone will guess it from the
extension of dest:path.
.PP
.TS
tab(@);
l l.
