      \-\-vfs\-read\-chunk\-size SizeSuffix         Read the source objects in chunks (default 128Mi)
      \-\-vfs\-read\-chunk\-size\-limit SizeSuffix   If greater than \-\-vfs\-read\-chunk\-size, double the chunk size after each chunk read, until the limit is reached (\(aqoff\(aq is unlimited) (default off)
