.SS References
rclone\(aqs bisync implementation was derived from the \c
.UR https://github.com/cjnaz/rclonesync-V2
rclonesync\-V2
.UE \c
\ project, including documentation and test mechanisms, with \c
.UR https://github.com/cjnaz
\(atcjnaz
.UE \c
\(aqs full support and encouragement.
.PP
\f[CR]rclone bisync\f[R] is similar in nature to a range of other
projects:
.IP \(bu 2
\c
.UR https://github.com/bcpierce00/unison
unison
.UE \c
.IP \(bu 2
\c
.UR https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing
syncthing
.UE \c
