.SS \-\-s3\-object\-lock\-mode
Object Lock mode to apply when uploading or copying objects.
.PP
Set this to apply Object Lock retention mode to objects.
If not set, no Object Lock mode is applied (even with \-\-metadata).
.PP
Note: To enable Object Lock retention, you must set BOTH
object_lock_mode AND object_lock_retain_until_date.
Setting only one has no effect.
.IP \(bu 2
GOVERNANCE: Set Object Lock mode to GOVERNANCE
.IP \(bu 2
COMPLIANCE: Set Object Lock mode to COMPLIANCE
.IP \(bu 2
copy: Copy the mode from the source object (requires \-\-metadata)
.PP
See:
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/object\-lock.html
.PP
Properties:
.IP \(bu 2
Config: object_lock_mode
.IP \(bu 2
Env Var: RCLONE_S3_OBJECT_LOCK_MODE
.IP \(bu 2
Type: string
.IP \(bu 2
Required: false
.IP \(bu 2
Examples:
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
\(dqGOVERNANCE\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Set Object Lock mode to GOVERNANCE
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dqCOMPLIANCE\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Set Object Lock mode to COMPLIANCE
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dqcopy\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Copy from source object (requires \-\-metadata)
.RE
.RE
.SS \-\-s3\-object\-lock\-retain\-until\-date
Object Lock retention until date to apply when uploading or copying
objects.
.PP
Set this to apply Object Lock retention date to objects.
If not set, no retention date is applied (even with \-\-metadata).
.PP
Note: To enable Object Lock retention, you must set BOTH
object_lock_mode AND object_lock_retain_until_date.
Setting only one has no effect.
.PP
Accepts: \- RFC 3339 format: 2030\-01\-02T15:04:05Z \- Duration from
now: 365d, 1y, 6M (days, years, months) \- copy: Copy the date from the
source object (requires \-\-metadata)
.PP
See:
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/object\-lock.html
.PP
Properties:
.IP \(bu 2
Config: object_lock_retain_until_date
.IP \(bu 2
Env Var: RCLONE_S3_OBJECT_LOCK_RETAIN_UNTIL_DATE
.IP \(bu 2
Type: string
.IP \(bu 2
Required: false
.IP \(bu 2
Examples:
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
\(dqcopy\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Copy from source object (requires \-\-metadata)
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dq2030\-01\-01T00:00:00Z\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Set specific date (RFC 3339 format)
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dq365d\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Set retention for 365 days from now
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dq1y\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Set retention for 1 year from now
.RE
.RE
.SS \-\-s3\-object\-lock\-legal\-hold\-status
Object Lock legal hold status to apply when uploading or copying
objects.
.PP
Set this to apply Object Lock legal hold to objects.
If not set, no legal hold is applied (even with \-\-metadata).
.PP
Note: Legal hold is independent of retention and can be set separately.
.IP \(bu 2
ON: Enable legal hold
.IP \(bu 2
OFF: Disable legal hold
.IP \(bu 2
copy: Copy the legal hold status from the source object (requires
\-\-metadata)
.PP
See:
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/object\-lock.html
.PP
