Enable legal hold
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dqOFF\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Disable legal hold
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
\(dqcopy\(dq
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Copy from source object (requires \-\-metadata)
