.SS \-\-s3\-object\-lock\-set\-after\-upload
Set Object Lock via separate API calls after upload.
.PP
Use this for S3\-compatible providers that don\(aqt support setting
Object Lock headers during PUT operations.
When enabled, Object Lock is set via separate PutObjectRetention and
PutObjectLegalHold API calls after the upload completes.
.PP
This adds extra API calls per object, so only enable if your provider
requires it.
