.SS RackCorp
\c
.UR https://www.rackcorp.com/storage/s3storage
RackCorp Object Storage
.UE \c
\ is an S3 compatible object storage platform from your friendly cloud
provider RackCorp.
The service is fast, reliable, well priced and located in many strategic
locations unserviced by others, to ensure you can maintain data
sovereignty.
.PP
Before you can use RackCorp Object Storage, you\(aqll need to \c
.UR https://www.rackcorp.com/signup
sign up
.UE \c
\ for an account on our \c
.UR https://portal.rackcorp.com
portal
.UE \c
\&.
Next you can create an \f[CR]access key\f[R], a \f[CR]secret key\f[R]
and \f[CR]buckets\f[R], in your location of choice with ease.
These details are required for the next steps of configuration, when
\f[CR]rclone config\f[R] asks for your \f[CR]access_key_id\f[R] and
\f[CR]secret_access_key\f[R].
.PP
Your config should end up looking a bit like this:
