.SS Limitations
Note that Box is case insensitive so you can\(aqt have a file called
\(dqHello.doc\(dq and one called \(dqhello.doc\(dq.
.PP
Box file names can\(aqt have the \f[CR]\(rs\f[R] character in.
rclone maps this to and from an identical looking unicode equivalent
\f[CR]＼\f[R] (U+FF3C Fullwidth Reverse Solidus).
.PP
Box only supports filenames up to 255 characters in length.
.PP
Box has \c
.UR https://developer.box.com/guides/api-calls/permissions-and-errors/rate-limits/
API rate limits
