.SS Limitations
dosya.dev only supports filenames up to 255 characters in length.
.PP
Empty files (0 bytes) cannot be uploaded to dosya.dev.
.PP
Upload requires knowing the file size in advance, so streaming uploads
of unknown\-size files are not supported.
.PP
Each workspace limits the number of uploads a user can have in flight at
once (5 by default, configurable in the workspace settings).
When \f[CR]\-\-transfers\f[R] is set higher than that limit, rclone
waits for a free upload slot rather than failing the transfer, retrying
every 5 seconds for up to 10 minutes.
.SS Deleting files and directories
rclone deletes files and directories permanently, in a single request
(\f[CR]DELETE ?permanent=1\f[R]), bypassing the workspace trash.
Removing a directory also asks the server whether it is empty
(\f[CR]?if_empty=1\f[R]) rather than listing it first.
