.SH FTP
FTP is the File Transfer Protocol.
Rclone FTP support is provided using the \c
.UR https://godoc.org/github.com/jlaffaye/ftp
github.com/jlaffaye/ftp
.UE \c
\ package.
.PP
Limitations of Rclone\(aqs FTP backend
.PP
Paths are specified as \f[CR]remote:path\f[R].
If the path does not begin with a \f[CR]/\f[R] it is relative to the
home directory of the user.
An empty path \f[CR]remote:\f[R] refers to the user\(aqs home directory.
.SS Configuration
To create an FTP configuration named \f[CR]remote\f[R], run
.IP
.EX
rclone config
.EE
.PP
Rclone config guides you through an interactive setup process.
A minimal rclone FTP remote definition only requires host, username and
password.
For an anonymous FTP server, see below.
.IP
.EX
