Here are the Advanced options specific to ftp (FTP).
.SS \-\-ftp\-concurrency
Maximum number of FTP simultaneous connections, 0 for unlimited.
.PP
Note that setting this is very likely to cause deadlocks so it should be
used with care.
.PP
If you are doing a sync or copy then make sure concurrency is one more
than the sum of \f[CR]\-\-transfers\f[R] and \f[CR]\-\-checkers\f[R].
.PP
If you use \f[CR]\-\-check\-first\f[R] then it just needs to be one more
than the maximum of \f[CR]\-\-checkers\f[R] and
\f[CR]\-\-transfers\f[R].
.PP
So for \f[CR]concurrency 3\f[R] you\(aqd use
\f[CR]\-\-checkers 2 \-\-transfers 2 \-\-check\-first\f[R] or
\f[CR]\-\-checkers 1 \-\-transfers 1\f[R].
