.SH Jottacloud
Jottacloud is a cloud storage service provider from a Norwegian company,
using its own datacenters in Norway.
.PP
In addition to the official service at \c
.UR https://www.jottacloud.com/
jottacloud.com
.UE \c
, it also provides white\-label solutions to different companies.
The following are currently supported by this backend, using a different
authentication setup as described below:
.IP \(bu 2
Elkjøp (with subsidiaries):
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Elkjøp Cloud (cloud.elkjop.no)
.IP \(bu 2
Elgiganten Cloud (cloud.elgiganten.dk)
.IP \(bu 2
Elgiganten Cloud (cloud.elgiganten.se)
.IP \(bu 2
ELKO Cloud (cloud.elko.is)
.IP \(bu 2
