and may change over time.
.SH Proton Drive
\c
.UR https://proton.me/drive
Proton Drive
.UE \c
\ is an end\-to\-end encrypted Swiss vault for your files that protects
your data.
.PP
This is an rclone backend for Proton Drive which supports the file
transfer features of Proton Drive using the same client\-side
encryption.
.PP
Due to the fact that Proton Drive doesn\(aqt publish its API
documentation, this backend is implemented with best efforts by reading
the open\-sourced client source code and observing the Proton Drive
traffic in the browser.
.PP
\f[B]NB\f[R] This backend is currently in Beta.
It is believed to be correct and all the integration tests pass.
However the Proton Drive protocol has evolved over time there may be
accounts it is not compatible with.
Please \c
.UR https://forum.rclone.org/
post on the rclone forum
.UE \c
\ if you find an incompatibility.
.PP
Paths are specified as \f[CR]remote:path\f[R]
.PP
Paths may be as deep as required, e.g.
\f[CR]remote:directory/subdirectory\f[R].
