password so needs to be configured with keys or certificates.
.PP
Rclone will run the command supplied either with the additional
arguments \(dq\-s sftp\(dq to access the SFTP subsystem or with commands
such as \(dqmd5sum /path/to/file\(dq appended to read checksums.
.PP
Any arguments with spaces in should be surrounded by \(dqdouble
quotes\(dq.
.PP
An example setting might be:
.IP
.EX
