Optional path to known_hosts file.
.PP
Set this value to enable server host key validation.
Set to \f[CR]none\f[R] to silence the \(dqNo host key validation\(dq
notice.
.PP
Leading \f[CR]\(ti\f[R] will be expanded in the file name as will
