.IP \(bu 2
Config: pin_host_key
.IP \(bu 2
Env Var: RCLONE_SFTP_PIN_HOST_KEY
.IP \(bu 2
Type: bool
.IP \(bu 2
Default: false
.SS \-\-sftp\-host\-keys
Pinned host keys for this remote, used to verify the server.
.PP
Comma\-separated list of \(dqalgo base64\-key\(dq entries (the same
format as the second and third fields of an OpenSSH known_hosts line).
Usually populated automatically by running once with
\-\-sftp\-pin\-host\-key, but can be set by hand to pin a server\(aqs
public key obtained out of band.
Note that each entry is the complete public key, not its SHA256
fingerprint.
.PP
When non\-empty, the offered host key must match one of the entries or
the connection is refused.
To re\-pin after a legitimate key change, clear this option and
reconnect with \-\-sftp\-pin\-host\-key, or edit the value directly.
.PP
At most 16 entries may be pinned.
.PP
