.SS \-\-sftp\-connections
Maximum number of SFTP simultaneous connections, 0 for unlimited.
.PP
Note that setting this is very likely to cause deadlocks so it should be
used with care.
.PP
If you are doing a sync or copy then make sure connections is one more
than the sum of \f[CR]\-\-transfers\f[R] and \f[CR]\-\-checkers\f[R].
.PP
If you use \f[CR]\-\-check\-first\f[R] then it just needs to be one more
than the maximum of \f[CR]\-\-checkers\f[R] and
\f[CR]\-\-transfers\f[R].
