.SH Uloz.to
Paths are specified as \f[CR]remote:path\f[R]
.PP
Paths may be as deep as required, e.g.
\f[CR]remote:directory/subdirectory\f[R].
.PP
The initial setup for Uloz.to involves filling in the user credentials.
\f[CR]rclone config\f[R] walks you through it.
