.SS \-\-zoho\-list\-folder\-window
The window for \-\-zoho\-list\-folder\-limit.
.PP
The default of 60s (shown as 1m0s) matches Zoho\(aqs real sliding
window: at most \-\-zoho\-list\-folder\-limit listings of one folder are
allowed in any window of this length.
A bare number is parsed as seconds (\(dq60\(dq = \(dq60s\(dq).
.PP
Widen it (or lower the limit) for a bigger safety margin; the sustained
spacing between same\-folder listings is window/(limit \- burst).
.PP
